      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/140018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:584b6cf51f40fbf07ee36568",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "明天也要\n记得来领取这个哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c34922b355e0a01bed8578b628d34d87e9d78d8bd940d3256e63e757079d104",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "15"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/15"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca59a9396749baff24927257",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还能跑…！双腿还能动…！\r\n来吧，今天也要全力以赴，\r\n超越极限…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ffe355970aa23da62023438f0524996033a4d921ab3e99a44ed7f0ef1b9ab97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e114ec834d872b24d2bc90c0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的计划是咖啡馆吗？\r\n…不是吗？我还以为，\r\n你差不多该说这个了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4402d009dd09c41b4dadcbc03906027b8db898fe6f53e2c1914e2ada0b157318",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:058431c2d7b2c546db2a239a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Today is my day!现在的话，\r\n就算是飓风或者鲨鱼袭来\r\n我感觉也能对付得了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "815b532eada7854f842352c50d55eecf79e6829b325f5fcd2e854a4ae1e937ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d48c3388653698a24f1294",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员！仔细～看看我？\r\n我是什么表情？…呵呵！没错，\r\n是渴望最棒训练的表情哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "450fa2ff6b729089d897d1b8b68b19c270503a446e3a8dff917afe6a148132b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4dbb669b7a21844fac957dc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们心电感应。那么今天是…？\r\nSay it with me:\r\n『提高负荷吧』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e46869de1c5f7c3f50a5d661fbb3561cd04d100f44c2badf81322598e59a303",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c016c7221d7797c490091695",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呐…我看起来是不是比平时\r\n更耀眼？——呵呵，今天一定能\r\n创造个人最佳成绩。严禁眨眼哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "25c7ee1dedf7d51fa12e1f38d9db52143e08329ad266db653aa7c68c6d0fc471",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25099f079829a82ab36aa8bf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥的训练理论很完美。\n值得尊敬…所以，\n我也要用我的方式去赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c952d4080065c068115e08836f8028d9a7e2973cebe9ea529fbd21b15ae51f96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c6153ede60d568c659d0509",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每天唯有不断磨炼双腿。\r\n哪怕只有一步也要比昨天更进一步\r\n…我想始终保持『最棒的我』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e287364cce229186b3d6c0fbff578f000cda226ac990a779ee2efe489a95d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c8d28f92d6df3f53d6bc94",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你应该没有时间停下脚步吧，\r\n勇敢之心…！不能因为\r\n状态不佳就心生娇纵…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb5cc121d48cc09e3773dd0e90a1dbc95c669a9d0e95c2ae08e81b48e801378c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8c3489736d51911171b4413",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "I'm okay...\r\n马上就振作起来。能让我先从\r\n集中精神开始吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e389d3771b236091f502b7b699590c8d54f6e27ec241b6484d6167e6bf31b992",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db05650331384cf965389300",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…唉。总觉得有点提不起劲。\r\n身体状况？气压？早餐的鱼卵？\r\n不行，不知道原因在哪里…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbf36ebc780391b1cc57ef23d984558052faf2cc339f958e28bbfe99b1ee1112",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a879c1b4f7dc96f9c584a87f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天不去瀑布修行吗？\r\n或者是蹦极！总之\r\n就是…我想脱胎换骨！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4f3a885f2f70338b55350f4008f18c9f4f764f3a90e05841881ab1e15de1d06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba8962915252db502d54dfaf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不觉得这是个好主意。\n逼迫自己和盲目行动是\n两回事。对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6630ec6c3f8fddfab6958cc6bc0e0d15a255710f0dc7f38d49800130c86346a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20021"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20021"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce38e010d6d89481150e681",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要想飞得高，也需要放松的时间…\r\n这是你教我的对吧？\r\n…我很信任这样的你哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c6b8d67ab6c99b23d82ef25da85bf533b4abef7ec2ab35b915af201a530c142",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20022"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20022"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a7de8d54d6c5cbd1ed95a30",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在夺得女王宝座之前，\r\n我绝不停止！我也会让你\r\n看到顶点的风景哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "40e0a2bbf0f5d89171f422a1f0fd587e037c2a170763285e9f093b3a9c20cf10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20023"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20023"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c9c81fe11c32268faf23449",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊…要开始了呢…！\r\nOur heart-pounding,\r\n炽热的激烈碰撞…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ed5d0cfb474070bbfa94db5d3ab51406fee265adfdae2033558d08cc3b9fbf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20024"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20024"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d900f0faf53f8d11de81b1d2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "I feel amazing!\r\n能为我准备好\r\n胜利的派对吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72dcbbae94a8dcd32ee29d43b06737d060b4f0d32dfb2585c4aad369004ec37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20025"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20025"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99bea784ccd934ba085caec1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你完美的训练菜单，我已经\r\n全部完成。在山中闭关磨炼到了\r\n极限。——我一定会赢的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4667dfcd162cd2280b1842eace4818aa741b1d260836249259386e7a59524070",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20026"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20026"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e5d530b278ad54e42d82694",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧张？…哎呀，想看我像小鹿\r\n一样发抖吗？——呵呵，抱歉。\r\n我恐怕无法回应你的期待了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c1c2dec4c26e8bafbeb77d2150a404e89cba63a62d7fed6918f157c6b575acf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20027"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20027"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f75a37299105e748a7280506",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大家表情都很不错…感觉都做了\r\n万全的准备。…啊，\r\n马上就要正面交锋了呢…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bc4b0fe0787be149431adf7a3c271426b84ac697c57e3183726fb5d2653f333",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20028"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20028"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1378fd255f7fa907610a2601",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的分析很完美。对手的\r\n情报、局势预测也是。接下来就看\r\n我的实力了…呵呵，交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b97e55fcfe1f402790db9e8ced7f21bb7ca7945c7a185d4db17f39b51fa2a049",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "20029"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1112/20029"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e80c8acbc948c0523ddc617d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Be bold, be brave!\r\nGo, Daring Heart!\r\n…呵呵，精神集中完毕。",
